<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span><h1>My Future Jobs</h1><p>Privacy Policy for the My Future Jobs Android application.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><p><strong>Last updated: September 7, 2026</strong></p><p><span class="tag">Pre-release draft</span></p><h2>1. About this app</h2><p>My Future Jobs is an educational career-exploration application developed by Kroma Digital.</p><h2>2. Personal information</h2><p>The planned application does not require account registration. The final release policy will describe any information stored or processed by the released version.</p><h2>3. Learning data</h2><p>Preferences, quiz results, favorites, progress, or similar learning information may be stored locally on the user's device. Final storage behavior will be verified before release.</p><h2>4. Children and young users</h2><p>The application is intended to support career learning. Kroma Digital aims to minimize collection of personal information and will review the released app against applicable Google Play requirements for its target audience.</p><h2>5. Third-party services</h2><p>Any analytics, advertising, billing, crash reporting, or other third-party SDKs included in the release will be disclosed here where required.</p><h2>6. Changes</h2><p>This draft will be updated before public release after the final Android permissions, SDKs, storage behavior, and Google Play Data safety declaration are verified.</p><h2>7. Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions can be sent through the Kroma Digital <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>